    {
      "data": {
        "text": "All requested files have been successfully created in the current working directory. The files include:\n\n1. fetch_db_secret.py - Fetches a database connection secret at runtime.\n2. parse_json_secret.py - Retrieves and parses a JSON-formatted secret.\n3. rotate_secret_version.py - Reads a specific secret version or staged value.\n4. security_client.py - Provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Secret Management.\n5. security_models.py - Defines local request, response, and normalization helpers for Secret Management.\n6. rotation_summary.py - Summarizes secret rotation status.\n7. secret_label_safety.py - Checks secret labels and notes for unsafe text.\n8. secret_audit_embedding.py - Embeds secret audit notes for semantic search.\n9. runbook_translate.py - Translates secret-rotation runbook notes.\n\nEach scored implementation file uses Google Cloud Secret Manager as the concrete external provider, making it identifiable in the code.",
